# --- Sierra/Dynamix IP — never commit ---------------------------------
# RESOURCE.MAP, RESOURCE.001, sound*.wav are obtained per-user
# (bring-your-own model). They live here for local development only.
# The Info.plist, version.plist, entitlements, etc. in Resources/ are
# project files and DO get committed; only the Sierra resource
# artefacts are excluded.
Resources/RESOURCE.*
Resources/sound*.wav
Resources/*.MAP
Resources/*.001
# Same for the Release/ bundled resource folder (it's a vendored
# copy of the user's local Sierra install; the repo is bring-your-own
# unless explicitly opted in via `git add -f`).
Release/Johnny Castaway Resources/RESOURCE.*
Release/Johnny Castaway Resources/*.MAP
Release/Johnny Castaway Resources/*.001
# Release/bundles/ holds the pre-built screensaver bundles (binary
# Mach-O + ad-hoc signature + entitlements). These are produced by
# the build scripts and staged by `bash Release/scripts/Install.sh
# --build-from-source`; they are not source files. The private mirror
# (giattijunior/johnny-castaway-macos-screensaver) tracks them via
# `git add -f`, the public mirror never does.
Release/bundles/
# The SHA256SUMS manifest is regenerated by the build pipeline and
# references the file paths under the private repo's working tree.
Release/manifests/SHA256SUMS

# --- Reference implementations ----------------------------------------
# These are public clones of jc_reborn / Johnny-Castaway-2026-Public /
# JCOS held locally for reference. Track via git submodules later if
# desired; not committed here.
Clones/

